6d. Volatility drag.  Arithmetic mean return is not what compounds.

    100% equities    arithmetic  9.23%  geometric  8.49%  drag  0.74 pp
    1.5x equities    arithmetic 12.34%  geometric 10.45%  drag  1.89 pp
    90/60            arithmetic  9.72%  geometric  9.27%  drag  0.44 pp

    The 1.5x equity portfolio loses the most to drag: same premium,
    much more variance.  That is the case against levering equity, and
    the case for levering a low-volatility, low-correlation asset.

